            <ArticleTitle>[Progress in the controlled release systems of hirudin].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>419-23</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Hirudin is very effective in treating and preventing cardiovascular disorders. In this review several polymeric controlled release systems of hirudin are introduced. The advantages of the local delivery for restenosis and the feasibility of endovascular drug-containing pharmaceutic stents for local therapy of cardiovascular thrombosis are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
